- `last_action_in_valid_action` reports whether the most recent action was legal under the valid-action list before it ran.
- `telemetry` contains recent state hashes, no-progress streak, HUD/gameplay change classification, and changed-cell samples.
- `telemetry['no_progress_streak']` counts consecutive actions without gameplay progress; `telemetry['repeated_action_streak']` counts consecutive identical actions.
- `level_transition` contains the last two frames and last five actions around the most recent level transition when one occurred.
